OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F391A1787925375
OL,1,W5j 5Q7kjs1 wsj#57sj  w{j#57i
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$ -,* %-.*,$%** %-& (,,,
OL,3,GNEWSADisorder at balloon release
OL,4,Aunacceptable, says MP
OL,5,
OL,6,FAssistant Chief Constable Jon McAdam
OL,7,Fsaid: "We utterly condemn anyone who
OL,8,Fwould use that tragedy as an excuse for
OL,9,Fdisorder and expect the overwhelming
OL,10,Fmajority of the public would join us in
OL,11,Fdoing so."
OL,13,FRedcar MP Anna Turley said the event
OL,14,F"put lives at risk" and left residents
OL,15,F"frightened and angry in their own
OL,16,Fcommunities"
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
